{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a Metroidvania-style action exploration adventure game. It tells the story of a world driven by rules and gears\u2014&quot;Sky City&quot;\u2014gradually collapsing. The player takes on the role of a life form that awakens in darkness, embarking on a journey to explore the world. As the forces, emotions, wisdom, and order of the world gradually crumble, each region descends into chaos and decay. Through exploration, the small life form gradually uncovers the truth about the world and life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game, with its stylized cartoon art and profound narrative, depicts the collapse of the world and the struggle for survival. Players will explore city-like maps, interact with unique NPCs, challenge bosses, collect cards, and ultimately confront the truth of the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604580?t=1743951697","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/cd03b0d70b0497bc392fcee60166790c687d67c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743951697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/92dfc2f11ebc4b440e8972913b0e5b87051156cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743951697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/92dfc2f11ebc4b440e8972913b0e5b87051156cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743951697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a Metroidvania-style action exploration adventure game. It tells the story of a world driven by rules and gears\u2014&quot;Sky City&quot;\u2014gradually collapsing. The player takes on the role of a life form that awakens in darkness, embarking on a journey to explore the world. As the forces, emotions, wisdom, and order of the world gradually crumble, each region descends into chaos and decay. Through exploration, the small life form gradually uncovers the truth about the world and life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game, with its stylized cartoon art and profound narrative, depicts the collapse of the world and the struggle for survival. Players will explore city-like maps, interact with unique NPCs, challenge bosses, collect cards, and ultimately confront the truth of the world.</p>","developers":["WangxoGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604580/e2083b08fd47b9475bd4c8e842b87b8aeabbbe30/header.jpg?t=1743951697","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122751,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122751/movie480.mp4?t=1743951695","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122751/movie_max.mp4?t=1743951695"},"name":"The Light Of Vertical001","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122751/97aff663e76db23173b375933c3ed1a942d016ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743951695","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122751/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743951695","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122751/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743951695"}}],"name":"The Light Of Vertical","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</